<title>USA: Zweig Fund Inc increases quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Zweig Fund Inc increases quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Zweig Fund Inc increased its quarterly dividend on Monday to $0.30 from $0.29 previously.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on July 25 to shareholders of record July 11.</p>
<p>The company said the $0.30 per share distribution is based on the fund's policy of paying a regular quarterly distribution of 2.5 percent of net asset value per quarter.</p>
<p>Zweig Fund is a closed-end fund with an investment objective to increase capital primarily through investment in equity securities.</p>
</text>
